---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import {packages} from '../data/wys-packages.js';
import {contents} from '../data/wys.js';
const notes=[['Choose your route','Amazon account path, website needs, optional persona, supported tools and budget.'],['Connect what you actually have','Save setup choices, available connections, approvals and the next action for anything missing.'],['Make one complete look','Theme and source records, three photo roles, graphics, channel copy and the blog article.'],['Repeat with checkpoints','Weekly planning, optional Outfit of the Day and reconciliation. Test before tasks run.'],['Give the look a home','Use the correct Idea List or your own approved Associates page; verify the exact destination.'],['Add a closet if it fits','An optional membership-dependent path using your own authorized lessons, with private material kept private.']];
---
<section class="wx-kit-band"><div class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-centered"><p class="wys-label">The system behind the content</p><h2>Pretty outputs.<br/><em>A repeatable way to make them.</em></h2><p>The planned kit is the guidance and prompts for your own setup. These are contents previews, not screenshots of final customer files.</p></div><div class="wx-kit-grid">{contents.map((c,i)=><details class={`wx-guide guide-${i%3}`}><summary><Image class="wb-guide-image" src={packages[i%2].photos[i%3].src} alt={packages[i%2].photos[i%3].alt} widths={[160,240]} sizes="120px"/><span class="wx-guide-number">{c.n}</span><span class="wx-guide-title">{c.title}</span><span class="wx-guide-tag">Open the contents preview +</span></summary><div><h3>{notes[i][0]}</h3><p>{notes[i][1]}</p><p>{c.text}</p></div></details>)}</div></div></section>
